**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Dd]ebug/
**/[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
publish/

# Visual Studio / Rider / VS Code (configuration locale)
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.suo
*.user
